    </page>

    <page>
        <paragraphs>
            <title>Graph Sketching</title>
            <p component="b" workspace="4in">
                So, what have we learned and done so far?
            </p>
            <p component="a">
                So, what have we learned and done so far? Increasing and decreasing, concavity, local max and min. Now we want to tie all of that together to help us sketch the graph of a function from derivative information. 
            </p>
        </paragraphs>
